.el .ds Aq '
.TH loom-benchmark 1  "loom-benchmark " 
.SH NAME
loom\-benchmark \- Run performance benchmarks and validate SLAs. RPC\-free local action
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBloom\-benchmark\fR [\fB\-\-iterations\fR] [\fB\-\-t\-platform\-ms\fR] [\fB\-\-binary\fR] [\fB\-\-meta\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-binary\-size\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run performance benchmarks and validate SLAs. RPC\-free local action
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-iterations\fR \fI<ITERATIONS>\fR [default: 1000]
Number of session\-create and receipt\-overhead iterations (min: 1)
.TP
\fB\-\-t\-platform\-ms\fR \fI<T_PLATFORM_MS>\fR [default: 5]
Synthetic platform latency per action in ms for overhead measurement. This represents the expected CDP call latency, subtracted from total measured time to compute receipt\-generation overhead
.TP
\fB\-\-binary\fR \fI<BINARY>\fR
Path to the loom binary for binary\-size check (defaults to argv[0])
.TP
\fB\-\-meta\-json\fR \fI<META_JSON>\fR
Override path to meta.json for binary\-size check
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-binary\-size\fR
Skip the binary\-size check (useful in dev builds without meta.json)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
